sh themselves to the limits. Find as many as you can to unlock more levels that provide a greater challenge and reach for 100% completion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/aee37e7f182934992d8f5df31d706200.avif?t=1778504742\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/7bf61e944065dfe203eb6a186b3addd9.poster.avif?t=1778504742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/7bf61e944065dfe203eb6a186b3addd9.webm?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/7bf61e944065dfe203eb6a186b3addd9.mp4?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items can only be reached by switching gravity. Levels will often have multiple ways to beat it and switching gravity if often the key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/0cc87dbc5339309834e60701eea00177.avif?t=1778504742\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/b98a6b906ab3cb77e3a0d5c85a4660ee.poster.avif?t=1778504742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850490/extras/b98a6b906ab3cb77e3a0d5c85a4660ee.webm?t=1778504742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src